# Service account keys — these can read and write the ENTIRE database.
# Added Sep 9 2026 for scripts/backfill-client-since.ts. Never commit one;
# AJ is a collaborator on this repo, not its owner, so a leak is not his to undo.
service-account.json
serviceAccountKey.json
*-service-account.json
*firebase-adminsdk*.json
# ^ leading wildcard is load-bearing: Google names the key
#   <projectId>-firebase-adminsdk-<hash>.json, so a pattern anchored at
#   "firebase-adminsdk" would NOT have matched the real filename.

# One-off script reports (carry client names) and local command captures
backups/
typecheck-now.txt
backfill-run.txt
